Cell["\<\
The equation satisfied by four-point function is Cas2pt[func] = Cas2pt[Pref \
** G] = EigenValue * Pref ** G. Hence the eigen-value equations satisfied by \
G is GrassmanInverse[Pref] ** Cas2pt[func] = EigenValue * G\
\>", "Text",
